    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting it all go\"... what does that even mean? when you say it's a valid thing to consider, it almost sounds like you're saying there's a way to just... opt out. like there's a version of this where the noise actually stops for good. because honestly, the idea of just being still and never having to wake up to this grind again is the only thing that sounds peaceful anymore.",
