      "content": "it feels so heavy, like even thinking about it is the only thing that gives me a sense of control. everyone expects me to just keep performing, to keep being the \"successful executive,\" but i'm just hollow. do you really think it's okay to feel like stopping everything is the only logical way out? like, instead of fighting to breathe in all this chaos, it's actually okay to just... stop?",
